{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/788","id":4881705562,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ07FcM8AAAABIvjqWg","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/pull/788","diff_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/pull/788.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/pull/788.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/issues/788","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/788/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/788/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/issues/788/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/statuses/5ebe8d315062c7db0855bfa760a0379012a51743","number":788,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(local): add experimental project identity and revisions","user":{"login":"schiste","id":15890754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODkwNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15890754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nAdd experimental Local project descriptor, FileId lineage, and immutable contribution revision contracts.\n\n## Contract\nProject identity is distinct from the host-local collaboration key. Exact content and path bytes define enrollment; rename continuity requires explicit exact-content evidence; copies, splits, and new files receive proposal-scoped IDs; uncertain rename candidates remain explicit. A revision binds project, contribution, exact base/result snapshots, source changes, and optional exact brief object bytes. These records grant no workflow authority.\n\n## Test plan\nAdded a descriptor fixture independently recomputed with Python standard-library SHA-256/canonical JSON and contract tests for clone mapping, rename/copy/split, namespace conflicts, and rationale-only revision changes. Ran rustfmt and `git diff --check`; Cargo tests were not run under the current runtime gate.\n\n## Eval impact\nNo evaluation code or fixtures changed; no evaluations were run.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T00:36:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T00:44:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"78e6a1596772672f941f44790de4112eff61aee8","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"schiste:agent/complete-local-l1-project-binding-file-l","ref":"agent/complete-local-l1-project-binding-file-l","repo":{"id":1129235824,"node_id":"R_kgDOQ07FcA","name":"Aethyme","full_name":"schiste/Aethyme","owner":{"login":"schiste","id":15890754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODkwNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15890754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/subscriptions","